	<div id="siteNotice"><div class="mw-dismissable-notice"><div class="mw-dismissable-notice-close" style="visibility: visible;">[<a tabindex="0" role="button">dismiss</a>]</div><div class="mw-dismissable-notice-body"><div id="localNotice" data-nosnippet=""><div class="sitenotice" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="message-card disclaimer-advice">
<div class="image-container"><span class="image" typeof="mw:File"><span><img alt="" src="./divider2_files/36px-Exclamation_Mark.png" decoding="async" width="36" height="36" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//cdn.wikimg.net/en/hkwiki/images/thumb/5/53/Exclamation_Mark.png/54px-Exclamation_Mark.png 1.5x, //cdn.wikimg.net/en/hkwiki/images/thumb/5/53/Exclamation_Mark.png/72px-Exclamation_Mark.png 2x" data-file-width="889" data-file-height="889"></span></span></div>
<div class="text-container">
<p class="paragraph typography--body1 typography--primary">We are aware of occasional site instability and are working to fix it.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="message-card disclaimer-info" style="text-align:center; justify-content: space-between;">
<div class="image-container"><span class="image" typeof="mw:File"><span title="The Knight"><img alt="The Knight" src="./divider2_files/40px-The_Knight_Idle.png" decoding="async" width="40" height="84" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//cdn.wikimg.net/en/hkwiki/images/thumb/4/47/The_Knight_Idle.png/60px-The_Knight_Idle.png 1.5x, //cdn.wikimg.net/en/hkwiki/images/4/47/The_Knight_Idle.png 2x" data-file-width="63" data-file-height="132"></span></span></div>
<div class="text-container">
<p><span class="typography-headline-3">Welcome to the Wiki! SPOILERS AHEAD</span></p>
<p>Want to help? <a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:CreateAccount" title="Special:CreateAccount">Create an account</a> or <a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:UserLogin" title="Special:UserLogin">log in</a> to get started!
</p><p>Be sure to check out our <a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Hollow_Knight_Wiki:Editing_Guidelines" title="Hollow Knight Wiki:Editing Guidelines">Editing Guidelines</a>, and use the Talk pages or visit our <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://discord.gg/DuVNd4s">Official Wiki Discord Server</a> before making any big changes.
</p><p>Enjoy your stay!
</p><p>-The Hollow Knight Wiki Team
</p>
</div>
