	<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-namespace">Template</span><span class="mw-page-title-separator">:</span><span class="mw-page-title-main">Hr</span></h1>
	<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
		<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Hollow Knight Wiki</div>
		<div id="contentSub"><div id="mw-content-subtitle"></div></div>
		<div id="contentSub2"></div>
		
		<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
		<a class="mw-jump-link" href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Template:Hr#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
		<a class="mw-jump-link" href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Template:Hr#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
		<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r117505"></style><div class="documentation"><div class="documentation-header-top"><span id="documentation-header-tools">[<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Template:Hr/doc" title="Template:Hr/doc">view</a>] [<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:EditPage/Template:Hr/doc" title="Special:EditPage/Template:Hr/doc">edit</a>] [<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:PageHistory/Template:Hr/doc" title="Special:PageHistory/Template:Hr/doc">history</a>] [<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:Purge/Template:Hr/doc" title="Special:Purge/Template:Hr/doc">refresh</a>]</span><span class="documentation-header-title">Documentation</span></div>
<p>This template serves to separate content in an article.
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Usage">Usage</h2></div>
<p>Type <code>{{<a class="mw-selflink selflink">Hr</a>|<span class="typography--secondary"><i>&lt;type&gt;</i></span>}}</code> to use, where <code class="typography--secondary">&lt;type&gt;</code> is either <code><b>small</b></code> (for a small version of the divider consisting of a gradient line) or <code><b>SS</b></code> (for a <a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Hollow_Knight:_Silksong" title="Hollow Knight: Silksong">Silksong</a>-themed divider). This parameter is optional.
</p><p>It is also possible to set a custom margin for the divider using the <code><b>margin</b></code> parameter or hide it on mobile by using the <code><b>showonmobile</b></code> parameter and setting it to <code>false</code>.
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Examples:">Examples:</h2></div>
<pre>{{Hr}}</pre>
<div style="clear: both;"></div>
<hr class="hk-divider">
<p><br>
</p>
<pre>{{Hr|SS}}</pre>
<div style="clear: both;"></div>
<hr class="ss-divider">
<p><br>
</p>
<pre>{{Hr|small}}</pre>
<div style="clear: both;"></div>
<hr class="gradient-divider" style="margin: 1.5rem 0;">
<pre>{{Hr|small|margin=96px 0}}</pre>
<div style="clear: both;"></div>
<hr class="gradient-divider" style="margin: 96px 0;">
<pre>{{Hr|showonmobile=false}}</pre>
<div style="clear: both;"></div>
<hr class="hk-divider hidden">
<div class="documentation-header-bottom"><span id="documentation-header-tools">[<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Template:Hr/doc" title="Template:Hr/doc">view</a>] [<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:EditPage/Template:Hr/doc" title="Special:EditPage/Template:Hr/doc">edit</a>] [<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:PageHistory/Template:Hr/doc" title="Special:PageHistory/Template:Hr/doc">history</a>] [<a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Special:Purge/Template:Hr/doc" title="Special:Purge/Template:Hr/doc">refresh</a>]</span>The above documentation is transcluded from <a href="https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Template:Hr/doc" title="Template:Hr/doc">Template:Hr/doc</a>.</div></div>

